## A figure taller than the viewport {#sec-dense-image}

An image is scaled to fit rather than scrolled, which is the opposite decision from the
two above and is deliberate: half a plot is not a plot.

<div class="tali-output"><img src="fit.png" alt="A test figure, scaled to fit its bound." style="height:60rem"></div>
